StartingIteration  1
XAXISTILT 3.5
LOG 0
SCALE 0 1000
PERPENDICULAR
MODE   2
FULLIMAGE 64 48
SUBSETSTART   0 0
AdjustOrigin 1
$if (-e ./savework) ./savework

text 58 golden/vert_skip/tilt_sirt-finish.com
